OL,3,AIran retaliates after US strikes kills
OL,4,Afour at wedding party, state media
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Iranian Red Crescent said four
OL,8,Fpeople including a young child were
OL,9,Fkilled in the US attacks, and more than
OL,10,F50 injured, when after a US missile
OL,11,Fattack shrapnel hit a home where a
OL,12,Fwedding celebration was taking place in
OL,13,FSirik in southern Iran.
OL,15,FIn response, Iran launched attacks at
OL,16,FUS military bases in Iraq and Jordan,
OL,17,Faccording to local state media and the
OL,18,FJordanian Armed Forces. Attacks were
OL,19,Falso reported in Kuwait and Bahrain.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
