OL,3,ARiver water smashed into tunnel and
OL,4,Achased me for 20 minutes, Nepal worker
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I ran towards the tunnel entrance," he
OL,8,Fsaid. "The water was chasing behind me
OL,9,Fand I was running ahead of it."
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
